      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm all for VRChat providing explicit clarity on what content is/is not allowed on the platform alongside clear reports on each offense when punishment is levied.\n\nFurthermore, due to the nature of the platform, adult content will always be a part of it. They should get ahead of the curve and permit the content under strict and clear guidelines. It felt like we were heading in that direction with age verification and content tagging, but I'm still waiting on a full implementation. Continuing as is with a subtle, inconsistent and underhanded approach to adult content moderation not only presents more risk that the content is exposed to minors, it makes it difficult for adults to feel like they have a space to be themselves. I hope the VRChat team can take a page out of Second Life's book for this one.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
