      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hope you get this resolved, it seems like VRChat threw the book at you with no reasonable explanation for your suspension and group removal. Something as simple as a warning with a clear explanation or rules broken could've saved a group that was years in the making, instead they destroyed a community overnight for something as simple as a sticker. VRChat needs to do better.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
