      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I agree. If you’re going to ban someone, they deserve a detailed explanation as to why. I know for a fact that Pridechaser is very careful about his group instances. It feels to me like this was a targeted attack from someone. If VRChat is going to ban or remove an account or group, there needs to be an explanation and evidence presented. Also, the person making the complaint must be investigated. Otherwise, anyone who wants to hurt someone can make complaints every time they get angry at someone. If you’re offended by something, say so. Don’t sit there and purposefully try to get them banned. People are so immature. Vrchat needs to do better.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
