      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "There was no point whatsoever to age verification if every member of your group is verified but you still get penalized for adult content.  Not explaining what content resulted in the ban and deleting a group rather that whatever post was in violation is just tyranny.  If VRCHAT continues to behave in this manner,  i will likely stop contributing financially.",
